{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日帰りに歌いながら歩いてたら、おもいっきり足をグギッとくじいて負傷しました。泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒール高めの靴履いてたからダメージ大きい。泣泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日に備えて、今日は湿布貼ってゆっくり寝ます(ﾉ_･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、帰りゆったんと電車乗ってたら喋ることに夢中になっちゃって、降りる駅より5駅過ぎてしまいました。泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日ほんっっっとについてない(･_･､)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悲しいぃぃぃぃいいいー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだよ！\n明日は新年最初のイベントです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は乃木坂の年になれるように、明日のイベントも全力で頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそしてそして！\nみさみさHappy Birthday"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"19歳の仲間入り(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスン終わってからみんなでお祝いしてケーキ食べました☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーみんなでお祝いするって楽しいわぃ(*^^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて、みさみさ誕生日おめでとう☆彡\n19歳コンビこれからも頑張ろうね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は大好きないくちゃんとの写真"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/05/dvc00840.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいいかわいい生田どん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また更新します☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、今年の目標はできるだけ毎日ブログ更新するっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張りますっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん。"}],"source":"archive"}